# Part 3 — Troubleshooting Quick Reference

| Problem                             | Command                               |
| ----------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- |
| Docker Engine is unreachable        | `docker info`                         |
| Container is stopped                | `docker ps -a`                        |
| Container exits unexpectedly        | `docker logs CONTAINER_NAME`          |
| Need detailed configuration         | `docker inspect CONTAINER_NAME`       |
| Need to enter a running container   | `docker exec -it CONTAINER_NAME bash` |
| Need to check resource consumption  | `docker stats`                        |
| Need to check disk usage            | `docker system df`                    |
| Need to check network configuration | `docker network ls`                   |
| Need to check mounted volumes       | `docker inspect CONTAINER_NAME`       |
| Need to check published ports       | `docker port CONTAINER_NAME`          |

